# Moziketo Wave

FastAPI backend for موزیکتو. PostgreSQL catalog. Pairs with `thereisnofork/moz`.

## Server

- SSH: `ssh moziketo` → `/opt/moziketo`
- Image: `ghcr.io/danielhej/moziketo-wave:<tag>`
- Full stack compose in `deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml`

## Stack

FastAPI · SQLAlchemy async · Alembic · PostgreSQL · Redis · OpenAPI `/openapi.json`

## Rules

- API prefix: `/api/v1`
- Migrations via Alembic; seed: `python scripts/seed.py`
- Conventional commits; commit only when user asks
